[1.3,"o","\r\n"]
[1.36,"o","unstale reads new release notes with a model, on your own key or your Codex plan.\r\n"]
[1.42,"o","None is set up here.\r\n"]
[1.48,"o","\r\n"]
[1.54,"o","  ● Set one up\r\n"]
[1.6,"o","    shows the one line to add\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","  ○ Not now\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","    free · deprecations, unmaintained packages and advisories: ≈ 27% of a full report's findings\r\n"]
[1.78,"o","\r\n"]
[1.84,"o","This repo's config suggests OpenAI: set OPENAI_API_KEY, then run `unstale setup`.\r\n"]
[1.9,"o","\r\n"]
[1.96,"o","↑↓ to move · Enter to choose\r\n"]
[2.02,"o","\r\n"]
[2.08,"o","Add one of these lines to your shell profile or this repo's .env, then run `unstale setup`:\r\n"]
[2.14,"o","\r\n"]
[2.2,"o","  OPENAI_API_KEY=<key>      OpenAI\r\n"]
[2.26,"o","  AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=<key>  Vercel AI Gateway\r\n"]
[2.32,"o","  OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<key>  OpenRouter\r\n"]
[2.38,"o","  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<key>   Anthropic\r\n"]
[2.44,"o","\r\n"]
[2.5,"o","Or use your Codex plan: install Codex and run `codex login`.\r\n"]
